<hgroup><h1>Rigidity for sticky discs</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Connelly%20R"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Robert Connelly</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
